WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:13.576
happening now?"

2
00:00:13.876 --> 00:00:14.556
Roxy asked.

3
00:00:15.457 --> 00:00:18.299
All the cubes moved down, bringing them below the stadium.

4
00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:23.322
They came to rest in a large room with lots of furniture.

5
00:00:24.403 --> 00:00:26.704
The Battle Master's voice came over a loudspeaker.

6
00:00:26.724 --> 00:00:29.106
"This is a rest period.

7
00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:31.808
You are free to move around."

8
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.660
The cubes disappeared.

9
00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.861
Cozlin ran over to Roxy.

10
00:00:35.881 --> 00:00:38.862
"Finally! We can walk around!"

11
00:00:38.882 --> 00:00:42.603
"Nice work, Rocket Girl," Wukong said.

12
00:00:42.623 --> 00:00:45.964
"I would have smashed Surina with my iron bar.

13
00:00:46.444 --> 00:00:48.824
But freezing her was a pretty good idea too."

14
00:00:49.565 --> 00:00:50.385
Roxy sighed.

15
00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:53.546
"I wish I didn't have to fight at all."

16
00:00:54.206 --> 00:00:55.006
Cozlin nodded.

17
00:00:55.026 --> 00:00:59.207
"But if we don't fight, we'll be stuck here forever."

18
00:00:59.847 --> 00:01:01.548
She looked around at the other fighters.

19
00:01:02.192 --> 00:01:03.273
Suddenly she gasped.

20
00:01:04.214 --> 00:01:04.874
"What's wrong?"

21
00:01:05.595 --> 00:01:07.216
Roxy looked over and gasped too.

22
00:01:07.896 --> 00:01:09.517
The dragon was curled up across the room.

23
00:01:10.218 --> 00:01:11.158
Wukong laughed.

24
00:01:11.879 --> 00:01:13.500
"Don't worry.

25
00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.501
The dragon isn't angry now.

26
00:01:16.082 --> 00:01:16.942
And it's not evil."

27
00:01:17.563 --> 00:01:18.804
Cozlin raised an eyebrow.

28
00:01:18.824 --> 00:01:20.245
"How do you know?"

29
00:01:20.265 --> 00:01:23.667
"That dragon is a spirit," Wukong said.

30
00:01:23.687 --> 00:01:24.968
"Just like I am.

31
00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:26.269
Follow me!"

32
00:01:26.829 --> 00:01:28.070
He walked over to the dragon.

33
00:01:28.971 --> 00:01:30.472
Roxy and Cozlin looked at each other.

34
00:01:31.072 --> 00:01:32.793
They shrugged and then followed the monkey.

35
00:01:32.813 --> 00:01:38.397
"Hi! I'm Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain."

36
00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:40.198
The dragon looked at him.

37
00:01:40.218 --> 00:01:44.561
"Are you the Sun Wukong who tried to take over Heaven?"

38
00:01:44.581 --> 00:01:46.022
Wukong grinned.

39
00:01:46.042 --> 00:01:49.064
"Yep! I got in big trouble for that."

40
00:01:49.685 --> 00:01:50.605
The dragon stood up.

41
00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:53.427
"My name is Sapphire."

42
00:01:54.268 --> 00:01:55.188
Cozlin frowned.

43
00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:57.710
"Why did you attack my city?"

44
00:01:58.631 --> 00:02:00.012
Sapphire narrowed her eyes.

45
00:02:00.712 --> 00:02:03.113
"You stole the sacred gold."

46
00:02:03.873 --> 00:02:05.093
Roxy scratched her head.

47
00:02:05.113 --> 00:02:06.794
"Sacred gold?"

48
00:02:06.814 --> 00:02:10.475
"Yes," Sapphire said.

49
00:02:10.495 --> 00:02:14.056
"Long ago a land was rocked by earthquakes.

50
00:02:14.716 --> 00:02:17.777
Buddha placed sacred gold under the land.

51
00:02:18.317 --> 00:02:21.018
The gold brought balance to the land."

52
00:02:21.758 --> 00:02:22.758
Cozlin bit her lip.

53
00:02:22.778 --> 00:02:24.939
"Oops. Sorry."

54
00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:28.060
"Hmph." Sapphire gave her a dirty look.

55
00:02:28.604 --> 00:02:31.765
"Buddha knew that thieves might try to steal the gold.

56
00:02:32.266 --> 00:02:34.166
He told me to guard it."

57
00:02:34.186 --> 00:02:38.008
"You were stuck underground for all those years?"

58
00:02:38.468 --> 00:02:39.248
Roxy asked.

59
00:02:39.809 --> 00:02:40.949
"That's awful."

60
00:02:41.689 --> 00:02:42.610
Sapphire smiled.

61
00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:44.911
"No, it was an honor.

62
00:02:45.551 --> 00:02:49.212
I was being punished for eating one of the Jade Emperor's horses.

63
00:02:49.813 --> 00:02:53.194
Buddha said I could earn forgiveness if I guarded the gold."

64
00:02:54.154 --> 00:02:55.395
Wukong's eyes lit up.

65
00:02:55.415 --> 00:02:58.056
"I'm trying to earn forgiveness too.

66
00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:01.366
I'm helping the Tang Monk reach the Western Paradise."

67
00:03:01.386 --> 00:03:04.428
"Wait a second," Roxy said suddenly.

68
00:03:04.448 --> 00:03:08.871
"You mentioned earthquakes What will happen if the gold isn't returned?"

69
00:03:09.672 --> 00:03:12.994
"The earthquakes will start again," Sapphire said.

70
00:03:13.014 --> 00:03:15.076
"Perhaps they already have.

71
00:03:15.536 --> 00:03:17.397
They will grow in strength.

72
00:03:18.138 --> 00:03:20.780
Each one will be more powerful than the last.

73
00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:24.102
Eventually they will destroy the land."

74
00:03:24.803 --> 00:03:25.683
Roxy gasped.

75
00:03:26.916 --> 00:03:28.116
"I have to get out of here!

76
00:03:28.476 --> 00:03:30.057
Metro City needs me!"

77
00:03:30.077 --> 00:03:34.018
"Take the next exit," Terrell said.

78
00:03:34.938 --> 00:03:36.919
He and Roxy's mom were driving toward the mountains.

79
00:03:36.939 --> 00:03:39.279
"I hope Dr.

80
00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.900
Odd can help us," Roxy's mom said.

81
00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.901
Rumble! Rumble!

82
00:03:44.521 --> 00:03:45.641
The earth shook again.

83
00:03:46.481 --> 00:03:49.542
Up ahead, the road buckled as a huge crack formed across it.

84
00:03:50.683 --> 00:03:51.423
"Oh no!"

85
00:03:52.123 --> 00:03:53.763
Roxy's mom slammed on the brakes.

86
00:03:54.404 --> 00:03:55.304
The car skidded.

87
00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:57.681
It stopped just as they reached the crack.

88
00:03:58.322 --> 00:04:00.804
The front wheels went over, but the rest of the car didn't.

89
00:04:00.824 --> 00:04:03.326
"Whew!" Terrell said.

90
00:04:03.346 --> 00:04:05.747
"That was—" Rumble!

91
00:04:06.328 --> 00:04:07.689
The earth shook again.

92
00:04:08.389 --> 00:04:11.632
The crack grew wider, and the car slid into the darkness!
